From: Gabriel Haberkamp <noreply@example.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:10:37 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] media retry: ask the phone to upload an expired media again
 (SendMediaRetry, DecryptMediaRetry, MediaRetry event 59)

whatsmeow already has SendMediaRetryReceipt and DecryptMediaRetryNotification;
neonize exported neither nor the events.MediaRetry answer. JSON in and out like
rawiq.go; the event is 59.
